{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/31f3393228d19914d64de6ff8c56fd6e.avif?t=1764167843\" width=790 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transform. Hunt. Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 2 allies to hunt a monstrous Gloomfiend in a city consumed by decay. But you\u2019re not alone, other Grimrunners stalk the same prey. Stay hidden and focus on the kill, or hunt them instead. Channel corruption to become a Grimspawn for bursts of monstrous power\u2026 but each transformation inches you closer to madness. <strong>Survive. Escape with the Seed.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/dec5863824d4c658733fd78004667cba.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Grimrunner, drink the Nocturn to lock in your transformation archetype, and shape your build through a flexible skill tree. Every choice changes how you move, fight, and survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/2bda185f0527e89f2029d6bd43e105f0.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster forms aren\u2019t cosmetic: they redefine your playstyle. Each archetype comes with distinct abilities, strengths, and synergies that unlock new ways to hunt, evade, or dominate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/1047d5f5e5ae913e79b0e390868c8613.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather strength and manage your sanity as you push toward the final encounter. Other hunters may help, or get in your way. Each run ends in a unique Gloomfiend showdown, with persistent upgrades carrying into future hunts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/b2332285995b87e5dc3ca757adef209d.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying urban sprawl full of verticality, interiors, and dark alleys. Hide in the shadows, sense nearby threats, and adapt to a world that evolves as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/63cd5a0cdfb815c1dc9ad944ffd99471.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others want the same prize. Pick your moment. Disappear\u2026 or strike. The wrong fight at the wrong time will cost you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/f1fb8777b47800bcaedc40a1f85f1fc5.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightholme draws from cosmic horror and folklore, twisting familiar archetypes into something new. The deeper you dig, the stranger it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightholme delivers a new kind of multiplayer horror, built on tension, transformation, and survival. Three-player teams navigate a corrupted open world, racing to summon and slay the Gloomfiend\u2026 while deciding whether to avoid other hunters, or become their fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108680?t=1764167843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/b9913bfd1f0b88ccd85ae970c454e67d727ad319/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764167843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/d4218b0502bfb05bdafd111fa0a08d4d5b030940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764167843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/d4218b0502bfb05bdafd111fa0a08d4d5b030940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764167843","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Stylized horror. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/31f3393228d19914d64de6ff8c56fd6e.avif?t=1764167843\" width=790 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transform. Hunt. Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with 2 allies to hunt a monstrous Gloomfiend in a city consumed by decay. But you\u2019re not alone, other Grimrunners stalk the same prey. Stay hidden and focus on the kill, or hunt them instead. Channel corruption to become a Grimspawn for bursts of monstrous power\u2026 but each transformation inches you closer to madness. <strong>Survive. Escape with the Seed.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/dec5863824d4c658733fd78004667cba.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Grimrunner, drink the Nocturn to lock in your transformation archetype, and shape your build through a flexible skill tree. Every choice changes how you move, fight, and survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/2bda185f0527e89f2029d6bd43e105f0.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster forms aren\u2019t cosmetic: they redefine your playstyle. Each archetype comes with distinct abilities, strengths, and synergies that unlock new ways to hunt, evade, or dominate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/1047d5f5e5ae913e79b0e390868c8613.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather strength and manage your sanity as you push toward the final encounter. Other hunters may help, or get in your way. Each run ends in a unique Gloomfiend showdown, with persistent upgrades carrying into future hunts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/b2332285995b87e5dc3ca757adef209d.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying urban sprawl full of verticality, interiors, and dark alleys. Hide in the shadows, sense nearby threats, and adapt to a world that evolves as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/63cd5a0cdfb815c1dc9ad944ffd99471.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others want the same prize. Pick your moment. Disappear\u2026 or strike. The wrong fight at the wrong time will cost you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/extras/f1fb8777b47800bcaedc40a1f85f1fc5.avif?t=1764167843\" width=616 height=136 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightholme draws from cosmic horror and folklore, twisting familiar archetypes into something new. The deeper you dig, the stranger it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightholme delivers a new kind of multiplayer horror, built on tension, transformation, and survival. Three-player teams navigate a corrupted open world, racing to summon and slay the Gloomfiend\u2026 while deciding whether to avoid other hunters, or become their fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio Ellipsis"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/e956bb36a7a3c3676ba7b17ae02f61dfa028454e/header.jpg?t=1764167843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108680/2023841662/d44e2f74dc846b837ea44d83465df4f3d50812ff/1761216226/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761223012","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108680/2023841662/d44e2f74dc846b837ea44d83465df4f3d50812ff/1761216226/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761223012","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108680/2023841662/d44e2f74dc846b837ea44d83465df4f3d50812ff/1761216226/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761223012","id":257221555,"name":"Nightholme | Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221555/ffebe53f9497ebc7f31365d9903910419042e0a9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761223012"}],"name":"Nightholme","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU 8th Gen 8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 2