":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/dc4bd68da1b9ffd51ab1e838bdd5ccf02254148a/ss_dc4bd68da1b9ffd51ab1e838bdd5ccf02254148a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764167843","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/dc4bd68da1b9ffd51ab1e838bdd5ccf02254148a/ss_dc4bd68da1b9ffd51ab1e838bdd5ccf02254148a.600x338.jpg?t=1764167843"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/07ea0afc82a2033e01b38a0974f73d8b4b712dba/ss_07ea0afc82a2033e01b38a0974f73d8b4b712dba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764167843","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108680/07ea0afc82a2033e01b38a0974f73d8b4b712dba/ss_07ea0afc82a2033e01b38a0974f73d8b4b712dba.600x338.jpg?t=1764167843"}],"short_description":"Team up with 2 allies to hunt a monstrous Gloomfiend in a city consumed by decay. Rival hunters stalk the same prey-stay hidden and finish the hunt, or stalk them instead. Channel corruption to become a Grimspawn, but each shift drags you closer to madness. Survive. Escape with the Seed.","steam_appid":4108680,"support_info":{"email":"support@nightholme.com","url":"https://www.nightholme.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.nightholme.com"}